# omp-config — environment template (HIGHLY OPTIMIZED)
# Installed to ~/.omp/agent/.env (chmod 600, gitignored). omp auto-loads it.
#
# Only OPENROUTER_API_KEY is strictly required. CONTEXT7_API_KEY unlocks the
# Context7 MCP server (mcp.json) for live, up-to-date library docs.
#
# Nothing else is needed: omp sends OpenRouter attribution + prompt-cache
# headers on its own, and per-model provider routing lives in models.yml.

# OpenRouter API key (https://openrouter.ai/keys) — required; every model
# routes through OpenRouter.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Context7 API key (https://context7.com/dashboard) — powers the Context7 MCP
# server (mcp.json) for up-to-date library docs. Optional but recommended.
CONTEXT7_API_KEY=

# Optional: Exa API key (https://dashboard.exa.ai) — upgrades the web_search
# tool. Exa is first in providers.webSearchOrder and already works keyless via
# its MCP fallback; a key raises limits and unlocks the full API.
# EXA_API_KEY=
